    "chunk_text": "ymb an M wintra \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Decius, an rice mon, beswac \u00feone casere, & feng him si\u00fe\u00fean to \u00feon anwalde. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & IIII, feng Decius to Romana onwalde, & & sona gedyde sweotol tacn \u00fe\u00e6t he Philippus \u00e6r besierede, mid \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee he het cristenra monna \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & VIII, feng Gallus Ostilianus to rice, & hit \u00dea wear\u00f0 eft Godes wracu on Rome: swa longe swa seo ehtnes w\u00e6s \u00feara cristenra monna, swa \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Emilianus ofslog Gallus, & h\u00e6fde him \u00feone anweald. \u00de\u00e6s eac on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00feriddan mon\u00f0e hiene mon ofslog. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & X, \u00fea gesetton Romane II caseras. O\u00feer w\u00e6s binnan Romebyrig, Gallienus w\u00e6s haten, o\u00feer w\u00e6s mid Emilitum \u00fe\u00e6m folce, \u00dea sceoldon on siml beon winnende \u00fe\u00e6r hit \u00feonne \u00feearf w\u00e6s. \u00dea bebudon hie begen cristenra monna ehtnesse. Ac hr\u00e6dlice on hie begen com Godes wracu. Ualerianus for mid fierde ongean Sapan, Persa cyning, & \u00fe\u00e6r gefongen w\u00e6s. & si\u00fe\u00fean he w\u00e6s Sapan \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge to \u00f0on geset, o\u00fe his lifes ende, \u00fe\u00e6t he swa oft sceolde & \u00fe\u00e6m o\u00ferum, Gallienuse, w\u00e6ron monog folc onwinnende, \u00fe\u00e6t he his rice mid micellre \u00c6rest Germanie \u00fee be Donua w\u00e6",
